WEBVTT

00:49.620 --> 00:49.660
Nanyou High School

00:51.550 --> 00:52.690
Spring has arrived.

00:53.870 --> 00:58.730
The freshmen have started and we've become sophomores.

00:58.970 --> 01:04.580
But because I just transfered here,
everything still seems very new to me.

01:04.930 --> 01:08.070
Every day is a riot.

01:08.610 --> 01:13.450
And contrary to the rumors I heard before coming here, everyone's really nice.

01:13.990 --> 01:18.710
The only mean ones around here are those bullies from Akehisa High School...

01:18.710 --> 01:21.100
Picking fights with Three and Itou...

01:24.520 --> 01:26.430
They're a rotten bunch.

01:27.150 --> 01:33.850
Though, since the incident, that yellow-belly Ryou seems to have grown a backbone.

01:39.160 --> 01:42.470
As childhood friends go, he's pretty reliable.

01:42.470 --> 01:45.120
I wonder if that's all thanks to Itou and Three too.

01:45.810 --> 01:49.810
Even so, those two are always getting into trouble.

01:49.810 --> 01:51.070
Today's no different.

01:50.870 --> 01:55.390
I'm a scalawag
who missed
breakfast and
snuck into
the canteen
before lunch

01:51.330 --> 01:53.870
Today's just not my day...

01:53.870 --> 01:55.540
Why is it always me?

01:55.810 --> 01:59.500
Anyway, every day is a barrel of laughs.

02:02.490 --> 02:06.090
Miss Akasaka, would you like to join Itou in the hallway?

02:06.910 --> 02:09.550
No, I'm fine, thanks. Sorry.

02:26.500 --> 02:27.910
So bored...

02:28.490 --> 02:31.540
What should I do to entertain myself today?

02:31.340 --> 02:36.850
Starting  today,  I'll!!

02:31.590 --> 02:36.850
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

02:36.850 --> 02:36.850
Starting  today,  I'll!!

02:38.430 --> 02:38.470
The Most Selfish
Man in Japan

02:41.560 --> 02:41.600
Niko 39

02:41.560 --> 02:41.600
Good Luck !!

02:41.560 --> 02:41.600
Freshman Sale  !

02:45.790 --> 02:47.510
Are you sure, Imai?

02:48.970 --> 02:49.980
About what?

02:50.330 --> 02:54.440
Don't play dumb. I'm talking
about the line at the register...

02:54.710 --> 02:56.680
The customers are starting to get impatient.

02:56.680 --> 03:00.230
It's fine. The rookie can handle it for us.

03:00.230 --> 03:03.340
Excuse me, the barcode isn't scanning...

03:03.340 --> 03:04.860
Just type it in instead.

03:05.950 --> 03:09.000
Tanigawa, I've had an epiphany.

03:09.000 --> 03:09.900
Another one?

03:09.900 --> 03:11.360
Hear me out.

03:11.360 --> 03:14.420
I've been taking things way too seriously up to this point.

03:14.420 --> 03:15.280
I see...

03:15.280 --> 03:19.630
Because of that, I let that idiot
Mitsuhashi screw me around.

03:19.630 --> 03:20.570
Don't you think?

03:20.790 --> 03:23.340
I-I guess...

03:23.340 --> 03:24.420
Excuse me...

03:24.420 --> 03:26.760
We're out of ten yen coins.

03:26.760 --> 03:28.020
Just use your own!

03:28.020 --> 03:28.990
Gimme a break...

03:28.990 --> 03:34.780
That's why I've decided that I'm just
gonna be straight-up <i>evil from now on.</i>

03:34.780 --> 03:37.220
Imai, help me out over here.

03:37.220 --> 03:42.060
Oh yeah, punch my time-card at five for me, will you? I'm taking off now!

03:42.060 --> 03:43.560
Gimme a break...

03:44.740 --> 03:46.580
I'm so evil.

03:46.580 --> 03:49.360
All you did was slack off.

03:51.130 --> 03:53.280
Itou's still being made to stand in the hallway.

03:53.280 --> 03:54.920
Poor guy.

03:54.920 --> 03:57.840
Mitsuhashi ditched him to save his own ass.

03:57.840 --> 03:59.840
What a no-good jerk.

04:00.130 --> 04:03.540
You're still badmouthing Three, Ryou?

04:03.540 --> 04:05.640
Well, Itou's a good guy,

04:05.640 --> 04:09.500
but Mitsuhashi's a scheming coward who can't even be classed as a man.

04:09.760 --> 04:10.670
That so?

04:10.670 --> 04:12.170
'Course it is!

04:20.490 --> 04:21.820
It's you guys...

04:23.730 --> 04:25.730
You're Mitsuhashi's floozy, aren't you?

04:25.730 --> 04:27.700
Come hang out with us for a bit.

04:27.700 --> 04:32.570
We won't try anything, so just come with us for a little while.

04:32.570 --> 04:33.640
No way.

04:37.660 --> 04:38.820
What's wrong?

04:38.820 --> 04:43.060
We just need you to act as bait to lure Mitsuhashi out.

04:43.060 --> 04:46.080
Now, behave yourselves and come with us.

04:46.080 --> 04:50.110
Hey, you're the guy who got his butt handed to him by Three a while back...

04:50.110 --> 04:51.560
...Akehisa's Sagara.

04:54.520 --> 04:59.140
Whatever. That dirty prick caught me off-guard.

04:59.140 --> 05:01.220
I'm gonna make him pay for that.

05:01.220 --> 05:03.330
What are you talking about?

05:03.330 --> 05:06.590
Weren't you the ones who started it in the first place?!

05:06.590 --> 05:10.200
It's not like Three and Itou whaled on you because they wanted to.

05:10.200 --> 05:11.420
What?

05:11.420 --> 05:12.780
I didn't hear you.

05:12.780 --> 05:13.400
Hey.

05:15.400 --> 05:19.070
Now, little missy, if you'll come with us...

05:19.080 --> 05:20.490
No!

05:26.610 --> 05:29.140
Keep your filthy hands off of me!

05:29.670 --> 05:32.750
How do you like that? Riko's
the heir to the Akasaka Dojo.

05:32.750 --> 05:36.030
Even if you all gang up on her, you're no match for her!

05:36.980 --> 05:38.960
Ooh, I'm shakin'!

05:38.960 --> 05:44.770
A shortie like you is heir to the
Akasaka Dojo? And all I have here are...

05:46.150 --> 05:47.670
these worthless shits!

05:47.670 --> 05:49.700
Whatever, you're still coming with us.

05:49.700 --> 05:50.590
Stop!

05:50.590 --> 05:52.660
I won't let you lay a hand on Riko!

05:52.660 --> 05:56.360
Well, well, if it isn't the Karate Kid himself!

06:00.230 --> 06:02.120
Want me to rearrange your face again?

06:02.120 --> 06:04.210
Shut your mouth! It'll be different this time!

06:04.210 --> 06:05.710
Knock it off, Ryou!

06:05.710 --> 06:09.120
Ooh, this is getting good.

06:10.300 --> 06:13.000
Come on, little boy! Bring it!

06:13.000 --> 06:14.520
Ryou, stop!

06:18.030 --> 06:22.100
I see that your bark is still worse than your bite,<i> Daniel-san</i>.

06:22.500 --> 06:24.220
And now, I'm gonna shut you up!

06:29.700 --> 06:30.890
Ryou!

06:30.890 --> 06:32.310
How dare you!

06:36.200 --> 06:37.940
I thought I told you to behave yourself, bitch!

06:40.160 --> 06:42.990
Now that you've finished
wasting our time, let's go.

06:42.990 --> 06:45.270
Girls are a lot cuter when they shut their traps and listen.

06:45.270 --> 06:46.910
Hold it.

06:48.530 --> 06:54.250
You worthless piece of Akehisa shit. Take your unworthy hands off her and scram.

06:54.250 --> 06:59.710
If you don't, Imai from Beni High might have to do something about it.

07:03.140 --> 07:04.210
Well?

07:04.210 --> 07:06.150
Did I nail it, Tanigawa?

07:06.150 --> 07:09.270
That was great, Imai! So cool!

07:11.120 --> 07:12.320
Good.

07:12.320 --> 07:15.580
Ah, I remember your stupid mug.

07:16.300 --> 07:18.020
You don't learn...

07:18.020 --> 07:21.320
Come back for another
beating, have you, Imai?

07:22.100 --> 07:27.700
You sure talk big for someone who fights dirty, Sagara.

07:27.700 --> 07:29.340
What the fuck did you say?!

07:29.340 --> 07:32.620
You just did something you should never do.

07:32.620 --> 07:34.330
Do you get me?

07:34.330 --> 07:38.250
You raised your hand against my sweet little Riko!

07:38.250 --> 07:40.140
He came straight out with it...

07:42.660 --> 07:46.680
A bruiser like you has got no business sounding so stupid!

07:46.680 --> 07:49.260
Quit flexing for the broad!

07:49.260 --> 07:50.520
What did you fucking say?!

07:52.950 --> 07:53.640
Take this!

07:56.340 --> 07:57.430
Imai...

07:57.430 --> 08:00.820
Beni High losers should understand their place in the food chain!

08:01.310 --> 08:03.390
Are you okay, Imai?

08:04.330 --> 08:06.540
That dirty sonovabitch!

08:06.750 --> 08:09.700
I ain't got time to deal with you dumbasses.

08:09.700 --> 08:11.760
Just stay down and catch some z's!

08:11.760 --> 08:12.840
Shut your pie hole!

08:12.840 --> 08:14.260
Who do you think you are?!

08:14.260 --> 08:15.760
Bring it!

08:22.700 --> 08:25.640
You never show up when you're needed...

08:25.640 --> 08:27.560
What are you playing at, Three?

08:48.730 --> 08:52.050
How long do you plan on
following me, you stupid mutt!

08:56.620 --> 08:58.410
What's with this dog?

08:58.410 --> 09:00.090
I wonder if he's hungry...

09:00.090 --> 09:00.850
Oh yeah...

09:02.410 --> 09:03.690
I wonder if he eats gum...

09:06.710 --> 09:09.990
You're actually pretty smart, despite your dopey face!

09:13.030 --> 09:15.050
You're friggin' sweet!

09:15.480 --> 09:16.510
Paw.

09:17.600 --> 09:18.490
Other paw.

09:19.940 --> 09:21.540
Duck.

09:27.430 --> 09:28.970
Not dick, you oaf!

09:31.940 --> 09:33.750
Your tile's <i>mine ! You lose big time!</i>

09:33.750 --> 09:34.840
Wrong move!

09:35.260 --> 09:36.800
Man, this blows...

09:36.800 --> 09:39.120
Where's your head at?

09:40.900 --> 09:42.000
Guys!

09:42.340 --> 09:43.960
There you are!

09:43.960 --> 09:44.730
Tanigawa!

09:44.730 --> 09:45.480
What's going down?

09:45.480 --> 09:47.940
Hurry! Imai's in trouble!

09:47.940 --> 09:49.590
What? He's in a fight?!

09:49.590 --> 09:50.220
Where?!

09:50.740 --> 09:52.050
You're gonna come?

09:52.050 --> 09:52.930
Thank God.

09:52.940 --> 09:54.460
Of course!

09:54.460 --> 09:56.270
Take us there, Tanigawa!

09:56.270 --> 09:58.720
So who's the bastard he's fighting?

09:58.720 --> 10:00.220
W-Well...

10:00.220 --> 10:01.670
Akehisa's Sagara...

10:01.670 --> 10:02.480
What?

10:02.480 --> 10:05.230
A-Akehisa's...

10:05.230 --> 10:06.190
...Sagara?

10:06.190 --> 10:07.700
Yeah...

10:07.700 --> 10:10.540
He's nothing compared to you guys, though.

10:10.540 --> 10:12.640
Yeah, you betcha...

10:13.120 --> 10:16.000
Akehisa is small fry...

10:16.000 --> 10:17.440
Come on, let's go!

10:20.570 --> 10:22.460
Wh-What's wrong, you guys?

10:22.460 --> 10:24.910
I-It's just that, uh...

10:24.910 --> 10:27.280
Ah! There's some stuff
I have to go take care of!

10:27.280 --> 10:28.940
Oh, me too!

10:28.940 --> 10:30.910
Sorry, you go on ahead.

10:30.910 --> 10:32.840
We'll catch up real soon.

10:32.840 --> 10:33.600
Sorry!

10:35.250 --> 10:37.220
Come on, guys!

10:43.550 --> 10:45.790
No way...

10:54.430 --> 10:58.140
What the hell, guys? He's supposed to be your friend, isn't he?

10:58.140 --> 11:00.990
You're just gonna turn tail and run when he's in a jam?

11:00.990 --> 11:02.560
How despicable.

11:03.780 --> 11:06.030
I guess it's all up to me now.

11:06.030 --> 11:08.470
I may be small, but I'll help him.

11:08.470 --> 11:11.890
Look where you're walking! I'm
Tanigawa from Beni High, you know!

11:11.890 --> 11:12.940
I know.

11:12.940 --> 11:13.940
Huh?

11:14.180 --> 11:17.560
Yo, what's with the scowl?

11:17.860 --> 11:19.480
I-Itou...

11:19.480 --> 11:20.540
Where's Imai?

11:20.540 --> 11:22.200
H-He's...

11:23.570 --> 11:25.700
Never mind.

11:25.700 --> 11:27.980
I can't get you involved.

11:29.100 --> 11:30.200
In what?

11:30.200 --> 11:31.530
Hey! Tanigawa!

11:32.880 --> 11:35.100
What'd Imai say if Itou bailed him out?

11:35.100 --> 11:36.600
Hey, Tanigawa!

11:36.600 --> 11:38.420
I said it was none of your business!

11:40.700 --> 11:43.260
If something's up, just tell me.

11:43.260 --> 11:47.000
We may go to different schools, but it's not like we're strangers.

11:47.000 --> 11:48.220
I'll hear you out.

11:50.290 --> 11:52.310
Itou... You...

11:58.640 --> 11:59.920
What's wrong?

12:00.320 --> 12:04.350
Beni High weaklings shouldn't go running their mouths. Shithead.

12:04.900 --> 12:07.990
It's your goddamn fault the skirt vamoosed.

12:07.990 --> 12:10.860
How're you gonna make up for that, huh?!

12:13.340 --> 12:15.280
Say something, you fucker!

12:15.280 --> 12:17.080
Cut it out.

12:21.340 --> 12:26.050
You sure talk big for someone who's attacked a guy four-on-one.

12:26.050 --> 12:27.960
Have you no shame?

12:29.820 --> 12:32.920
Well, if it isn't Itou the teary-eyed bum.

12:33.510 --> 12:36.940
Have you come to plead for forgiveness again?

12:39.300 --> 12:42.180
Didn't we settle this last time?

12:42.180 --> 12:45.140
Or are you saying it's still on?

12:47.270 --> 12:48.940
What if I am?

12:49.660 --> 12:52.460
Let's get a change of scenery and I'll hear you out.

12:52.460 --> 12:53.200
Come on.

12:54.980 --> 12:56.050
Classic.

12:59.330 --> 13:00.560
Don't do it. Itou...

13:00.560 --> 13:03.160
Are you okay? Imai! Imai!

13:04.670 --> 13:06.920
So you brought Itou here?

13:07.210 --> 13:10.380
Sorry, I couldn't find anyone else, so...

13:10.980 --> 13:13.480
Bringing him into our business...

13:14.030 --> 13:15.690
We're going after them, Tanigawa!

13:15.690 --> 13:16.560
Okay!

13:20.340 --> 13:24.130
How long do you plan on
following me?! Go home already!

13:25.050 --> 13:27.070
What the hell are you trying to do?

13:34.080 --> 13:36.240
What are those two doing there?

13:42.220 --> 13:44.170
Are you okay, Ryou?

13:44.170 --> 13:45.150
Yeah.

13:49.520 --> 13:51.710
Oh, it's that doggy again!

13:58.930 --> 14:02.020
Ah, this is, um... I just grazed it.
Nothing to worry about—

14:02.020 --> 14:03.520
It's your fault, Mitsuhashi!

14:03.520 --> 14:04.100
Ryou!

14:04.500 --> 14:07.470
You made trouble with Akehisa and now Sagara's going after Riko—

14:07.470 --> 14:08.710
Ryou!

14:10.610 --> 14:12.110
Sagara did what?

14:12.110 --> 14:13.900
It's nothing, Three!

14:14.220 --> 14:17.730
Some guys tried hitting on me because I'm so cute and all...

14:19.400 --> 14:20.820
You know what I mean?

14:21.320 --> 14:23.200
Don't play dumb with me.

14:23.200 --> 14:23.900
Huh?

14:23.900 --> 14:25.780
They were just teasing you.

14:25.780 --> 14:28.040
Who'd try to pick up a shrimp like you?

14:28.040 --> 14:29.770
What did you say?!

14:29.770 --> 14:32.770
Come back when you're out of training pants!

14:33.830 --> 14:35.140
Three!

14:35.140 --> 14:38.840
Riko, you're wasting your time worrying about someone like Mitsuhashi.

14:39.230 --> 14:42.620
But if I tell him what happened, he'll get into another fight!

14:42.620 --> 14:44.420
Not a chance...

14:44.420 --> 14:47.790
He's not the kind of guy who'd do something for someone else.

14:49.500 --> 14:52.020
Stop following me already!

14:52.020 --> 14:52.900
Scat! Shoo!

14:55.560 --> 14:56.810
Three...

14:57.170 --> 14:57.210
Realties

14:57.170 --> 14:57.210
By Order of
the Management

14:57.170 --> 14:57.210
No Trespassing

15:03.100 --> 15:06.020
Tell me something before I beat you to a pulp...

15:06.300 --> 15:08.970
Why did you attack one of our students?

15:08.970 --> 15:10.420
Out with it.

15:11.440 --> 15:15.340
You're acting all high and mighty for a no-good, dirty bum, Itou.

15:16.270 --> 15:19.520
You're one to talk, considering you were pulverized last time.

15:19.540 --> 15:22.390
That dirty bastard sucker punched me.

15:22.390 --> 15:24.560
You can't brag about that.

15:25.620 --> 15:26.640
Like I've already said...

15:26.640 --> 15:30.280
That guy's my friend. It's the same as if I did it.

15:30.280 --> 15:32.160
Oh, that so?

15:32.160 --> 15:35.320
In that case, I'll make sure I pay you back for that too.

15:35.900 --> 15:38.580
You see, our school breeds meatheads not brainiacs.

15:38.580 --> 15:41.280
If other schools start thinking they can out-muscle us, our reputation's dirt!

15:42.490 --> 15:44.110
Makes sense, surprisingly.

15:44.110 --> 15:48.460
But why would someone who acts all hard target a woman?

15:48.460 --> 15:49.660
Shut the fuck up!

15:49.660 --> 15:51.870
You land the first blow, you win the fight.

15:52.370 --> 15:54.760
I'd sell my own mother just to win.

15:56.180 --> 15:59.050
You and Mitsuhashi should fight it out to see who's dirtier.

15:59.050 --> 16:04.100
He's the kinda guy who betrays his friends just so he can come out ahead.

16:05.580 --> 16:06.760
Even so...

16:08.020 --> 16:12.480
You're both cowards, but he's got such a heart of gold, it almost makes me vomit.

16:12.820 --> 16:15.060
That's why we're friends.

16:15.060 --> 16:18.660
And I just can't forgive anyone who tries to hurt my friends!

16:18.660 --> 16:23.750
I'm amazed you can spew cheesy lines like that without even flinching.

16:25.540 --> 16:27.620
Bravo! Bravo!

16:27.620 --> 16:28.970
Y-You!

16:28.970 --> 16:29.950
Mitsuhashi...

16:30.200 --> 16:37.380
That was so moving. Before I knew it, I was crying like a little girl, Itou.

16:37.380 --> 16:37.960
Mitsuhashi!

16:38.440 --> 16:41.590
You've got some balls, parading your ugly mug in front of me.

16:41.590 --> 16:42.840
Stay out of this!

16:42.840 --> 16:45.030
Honestly, it's fine, Itou.

16:45.030 --> 16:45.800
It's all fine now.

16:45.800 --> 16:47.490
It's not fine!

16:47.490 --> 16:51.780
I can't relax until I've kicked this motherfucker's ass once and for all!

16:51.780 --> 16:56.600
Not on your life! I can't let you have all the fun.

16:57.260 --> 17:02.200
Anyway, unless I unleash another can of whoop-ass on him,

17:02.870 --> 17:05.070
I'll still be pissed off!

17:07.670 --> 17:10.160
Well, looks like they outran us in the end.

17:10.160 --> 17:12.380
Yep, we lost 'em good, didn't we?

17:13.260 --> 17:14.760
Sorry.

17:15.290 --> 17:17.420
I shouldn't have asked Itou for help.

17:17.980 --> 17:20.050
It's fine.

17:20.050 --> 17:24.880
More importantly, I looked pretty lame in front of Riko.

17:25.510 --> 17:26.740
Imai.

17:31.300 --> 17:33.260
It's you guys again?

17:33.260 --> 17:35.280
What the hell do you want?

17:35.520 --> 17:37.390
Just call us Sagara's reinforcements.

17:37.390 --> 17:39.240
Out with it. Where is he?

17:40.420 --> 17:44.230
Before I tell you, you get to have some fun with me!

17:50.460 --> 17:53.340
I can't afford to owe Itou any more favors!

17:53.340 --> 17:55.620
Lights out for you!

18:02.220 --> 18:06.060
That's what you get for attacking someone who's got nothing to do with this, asshole.

18:07.150 --> 18:09.020
It's because you picked a fight with Akehisa.

18:09.020 --> 18:11.570
Then, come after <i>me , you cocksucker!</i>

18:11.570 --> 18:13.930
Fucking pussy!

18:14.300 --> 18:16.230
I don't care that you're from Akehisa!

18:16.230 --> 18:19.310
No man should raise a hand against a woman!

18:19.710 --> 18:25.820
Come and fucking fight <i>me before you start talking shit!</i>

18:25.820 --> 18:27.380
You listening?!

18:27.380 --> 18:28.960
Stop! Mitsuhashi!

18:29.180 --> 18:30.740
What are you doing, Itou?!

18:30.740 --> 18:32.140
I'll fucking kill you too!

18:32.140 --> 18:33.230
Calm down!

18:33.230 --> 18:35.490
It's over. Sagara's out for the count!

18:45.780 --> 18:48.760
Calm down, Mitsuhashi. You've won.

18:54.640 --> 18:57.460
Now you've done it, Imai.

18:57.460 --> 18:58.840
Yeah...

18:59.500 --> 19:02.160
I'm exhausted.

19:07.090 --> 19:09.240
You guys did this?

19:09.480 --> 19:11.510
Yeah, looks like.

19:11.510 --> 19:12.280
How'd you do?

19:12.620 --> 19:15.520
Mitsuhashi stole the win from me.

19:15.520 --> 19:18.670
Not sure why, but he really lost it this time.

19:19.250 --> 19:20.660
I wonder what happened...

19:20.660 --> 19:21.690
Shut it.

19:21.690 --> 19:24.130
Oh, he's blushing.

19:24.130 --> 19:25.880
What are you trying to say?!

19:25.880 --> 19:28.580
I wonder what the reason behind it is...

19:28.580 --> 19:30.220
I don't really care,

19:30.220 --> 19:33.600
but knowing Mitsuhashi,
I'm sure he didn't fight fair.

19:35.260 --> 19:38.820
What about you? Did you hurl a grenade or something to take out these five?

19:39.330 --> 19:41.580
I'm not like you, Mitsuhashi.

19:41.580 --> 19:43.740
You saw it all, didn't you?

19:43.740 --> 19:45.460
Good dog. Good dog.

19:45.460 --> 19:47.200
Gimme your paw.

19:48.040 --> 19:49.680
Duck.

19:52.000 --> 19:54.960
What the hell is wrong with you?!

20:04.060 --> 20:04.100
Akehisa High School

20:16.500 --> 20:17.500
I see...

20:17.500 --> 20:19.120
Sagara was beaten up again?

20:19.120 --> 20:21.900
Yeah, they hospitalized him.

20:21.900 --> 20:23.980
You serious?

20:23.980 --> 20:26.860
Nanyou's too weak to even joke about them doing that.

20:26.870 --> 20:29.300
What'll you do, Satoshi?

20:29.780 --> 20:33.320
I didn't think we'd have to get serious with those termites.

20:33.640 --> 20:35.290
I guess I underestimated them.

20:37.580 --> 20:38.860
Gather the gang!

20:38.860 --> 20:40.340
Satoshi! Where are you?!

20:45.820 --> 20:47.580
There you are.

20:47.580 --> 20:50.860
What the hell are you guys doing, standing around in the dark?

20:52.140 --> 20:52.810
Yo!

20:55.600 --> 20:57.260
Yo, Maruda.

20:58.050 --> 21:03.110
You're pretty laid back considering everything that's going on!

21:03.500 --> 21:05.140
What are you talking about?

21:06.100 --> 21:07.830
Don't act dumb with me!

21:07.830 --> 21:11.160
Nanyou's making a laughing stock outta us!

21:12.170 --> 21:14.860
We were about to go teach them a lesson.

21:14.860 --> 21:16.410
You're too late!

21:16.410 --> 21:18.980
It's your fault that Akehisa's lost face here!

21:18.980 --> 21:21.920
And as the former boss, this shit rolls uphill!

21:24.880 --> 21:26.540
What's with that look?!

21:27.520 --> 21:31.510
Did you forget who made you boss around here, huh?!

21:31.510 --> 21:36.300
It's thanks to me that you get to act like a big shot in here!

21:36.900 --> 21:37.760
Yes.

21:37.760 --> 21:39.630
Shut your trap!

21:39.630 --> 21:43.210
Why the fuck can't you wipe Nanyou out?

21:43.210 --> 21:46.520
You balls up again, me and the original crew will find ourselves a new leader!

21:46.780 --> 21:47.910
Got it?!

21:47.910 --> 21:48.820
Yes.

21:48.820 --> 21:50.200
You dumb shit.

21:51.720 --> 21:53.890
Too dark to see anything in there...

21:54.630 --> 21:56.540
Satoshi! You all right?

21:56.540 --> 21:57.630
Satoshi!

22:02.240 --> 22:03.390
Fucking dick!

22:04.330 --> 22:08.330
Why can't he just stay retired and keep his fucking nose out of my business?

22:11.190 --> 22:13.030
I don't care how many guys it takes!

22:13.030 --> 22:15.640
Bring those two guys from Nanyou to me!

22:15.910 --> 22:17.170
Y-Yes, Boss!

22:21.900 --> 22:23.570
Now that it's come to this,

22:23.570 --> 22:27.820
I'm gonna have to use my fists to spell out that you don't mess with Akehisa.

22:41.550 --> 22:44.200
How are you holding up, Imai?

22:44.660 --> 22:47.650
Don't sweat it. That was a breeze.

22:47.650 --> 22:50.160
Sorry for asking Itou for help.

22:50.880 --> 22:53.390
It's fine. Don't worry about it, Tanigawa.

22:53.390 --> 22:55.880
After all, he wasn't completely unrelated to this whole thing.

22:55.880 --> 22:57.000
Okay.

23:01.840 --> 23:04.700
C'mon! Out with it!

23:12.830 --> 23:16.280
Looks like all of Akehisa is out today.

23:16.280 --> 23:19.180
Yeah, this is bad...

23:20.550 --> 23:20.590
Niko 39

23:20.550 --> 23:20.590
Good Luck !!

23:20.550 --> 23:20.590
Freshman Sale  !

23:28.570 --> 23:30.710
Oh! Imai.

23:30.710 --> 23:32.620
You're late, lover boy.

23:33.450 --> 23:35.600
What the fuck are you guys doing?!

23:35.920 --> 23:38.050
And why the fuck are you just standing there?!

23:38.050 --> 23:41.240
They said they were your friends...

23:41.240 --> 23:43.820
These guys aren't my goddamn friends!

23:43.820 --> 23:45.660
You're so cold, Imai.

23:45.660 --> 23:48.110
Do you even know what shit's going down because of you?

23:48.110 --> 23:50.860
This is no time for a fucking picnic!

23:50.860 --> 23:51.820
What do you mean?

23:51.820 --> 23:54.780
Akehisa thugs are crawling all over the place looking for you guys.

23:54.780 --> 23:55.980
What?!

23:55.980 --> 23:57.030
Really?

23:57.030 --> 23:58.460
No fighting.

23:58.460 --> 23:59.940
O-Okay.

23:59.940 --> 24:02.220
Itou! This is your fault!

24:02.220 --> 24:05.030
What?! Are you brain-dead?

24:05.030 --> 24:06.650
You're the one who beat up Sagara!

24:06.650 --> 24:09.010
You trying to start something?!

24:09.470 --> 24:11.420
Bring it! Let's take this outside!

24:11.420 --> 24:12.660
Fine by me!

24:12.660 --> 24:15.830
I planned on settling things with you some day!

24:16.370 --> 24:19.150
Don't start pretending you're a hotshot!

24:19.150 --> 24:20.590
I said no fighting!

24:20.590 --> 24:22.220
Anyway, we'll settle it out here!

24:22.220 --> 24:23.620
Perfect!

24:23.620 --> 24:24.870
Damn bastard!

24:26.890 --> 24:29.180
Imai... That's shoplifting...

24:29.180 --> 24:32.150
It's fine. We've caught
ourselves a straggler.

24:37.110 --> 24:40.070
I think he was with them.

24:40.070 --> 24:43.950
There's always one unlucky bastard in every group.

24:44.300 --> 24:47.420
Three, you're so bad, shoplifting like that...

24:47.990 --> 24:51.230
And what exactly are you carrying there?

25:02.330 --> 25:03.410
Mitsuhashi.

25:03.410 --> 25:04.300
Yeah.

25:05.310 --> 25:07.030
You guys go home.

25:07.030 --> 25:08.800
Sorry, but we've got some business to take care of.

25:09.090 --> 25:12.100
Huh? What's this all of a
sudden? What business?

25:12.100 --> 25:14.580
Just do as you're told and go home.

25:14.580 --> 25:15.780
What's with you?

25:15.780 --> 25:17.890
Quit your mewling.

25:18.180 --> 25:19.260
Sorry.

25:19.260 --> 25:20.380
I'll call you later.

25:20.380 --> 25:21.630
Itou!

25:27.460 --> 25:28.740
Go home!

25:29.860 --> 25:31.360
We were only playing!

25:31.360 --> 25:33.690
Okay, bye now.

25:40.610 --> 25:42.920
Japanese. Do you speak it?

25:44.200 --> 25:46.680
You're pretty cute when you're angry.

25:46.980 --> 25:48.030
Christ.

25:54.460 --> 25:56.360
For the love of all that's holy, I said <i>go home !</i>

25:59.330 --> 26:01.150
You too, Fido.

26:08.560 --> 26:09.830
About here should be fine.

26:10.190 --> 26:11.050
Yeah.

26:25.020 --> 26:27.010
At least they've come out in force this time.

26:27.340 --> 26:28.570
Oh well...

26:28.570 --> 26:32.580
Guess I'll just have to teach them that one versus a hundred is still a walkover for me.

26:32.580 --> 26:33.870
Right? Mitsuha—

26:39.540 --> 26:40.380
Itou!

26:40.380 --> 26:42.440
I'll leave them to you! Good luck!

26:42.440 --> 26:44.700
Y-You rat bastard!

26:44.700 --> 26:46.810
Wait!

26:51.070 --> 26:53.260
What are you doing, leaving me behind?!

26:53.260 --> 26:56.440
You said you'd have no problem fighting one versus a hundred, didn't you?!

26:56.440 --> 26:59.750
I-I take it back. I don't like getting punched.

27:00.120 --> 27:02.070
Well, at least you're honest...

27:02.460 --> 27:06.000
Anyway, we're getting the hell outta Dodge!

27:20.680 --> 27:22.270
They sure are persistent...

27:25.450 --> 27:26.020
Itou!

27:29.330 --> 27:31.500
I'm done for. I can't run any further.

27:31.500 --> 27:33.910
You bonehead! Get up!

27:37.990 --> 27:38.960
Itou!

27:39.530 --> 27:41.920
Don't worry about me! Save yourself!

27:41.920 --> 27:43.490
Oh, okay.

27:43.490 --> 27:44.370
See you later!

27:45.440 --> 27:47.800
Gimme a break!

27:50.100 --> 27:51.620
Were you really gonna leave me behind?!

27:51.620 --> 27:54.720
You told me to save myself, didn't you?

27:54.530 --> 27:54.570
Japanese Fire Extinguishers

28:03.400 --> 28:05.450
These guys just keep coming!

28:05.450 --> 28:08.070
They need to give up already.

28:14.610 --> 28:16.900
Crap, it's Akehisa's boss.

28:16.900 --> 28:18.150
This guy?

28:18.550 --> 28:20.270
He's pretty big...

28:25.650 --> 28:29.460
Talk about getting caught between a rock and a fireplace.

28:29.460 --> 28:31.340
Don't you mean "a rock and a hard place"?

28:32.150 --> 28:34.140
For fuck's sake...

28:34.810 --> 28:37.070
Things just aren't going my way...

28:37.430 --> 28:42.680
I should stay the hell away from Mitsuhashi. He's like a plague of misfortune.

28:47.450 --> 28:49.180
Hey, Imai.

28:49.730 --> 28:51.740
Tell us where Mitsuhashi's at.

28:55.750 --> 28:57.660
How should I know?

28:58.070 --> 29:01.220
You're his friend, aren't you?

29:01.220 --> 29:02.550
Stop fooling around.

29:02.550 --> 29:04.380
I don't even want to see his face again.

29:04.380 --> 29:06.380
Then, help us out.

29:06.740 --> 29:08.070
Help you?

29:08.570 --> 29:10.300
What do you plan on doing with Mitsuhashi?

29:11.540 --> 29:12.840
It's obvious, isn't it?

29:12.840 --> 29:17.770
We're gonna show him what happens to people who mess with Akehisa.

29:20.300 --> 29:21.640
You chickenshit!

29:25.780 --> 29:27.720
Wh-What the hell are you doing?!

29:27.720 --> 29:29.520
That was a cheap shot!

29:29.850 --> 29:33.490
You guys were getting all worked up, so I decided to help you cool off.

29:33.490 --> 29:34.860
You should thank me.

29:36.490 --> 29:37.110
Fuck you!

29:42.660 --> 29:44.780
I'm the one who's gonna beat up Mitsuhashi.

29:44.780 --> 29:46.800
Stay out of my way! You got that?

29:50.000 --> 29:52.130
I'm pretty sure Three came this way...

29:52.420 --> 29:54.520
I don't want them to fight anymore.

29:58.180 --> 29:59.420
Huh?

29:59.420 --> 30:01.540
We're missing one of the extinguishers we were gonna throw out.

30:01.540 --> 30:04.060
What do you expect if you leave them lying around?

30:04.410 --> 30:04.450
Japanese Fire Extinguishers

30:05.010 --> 30:08.010
Oh well, it's not like it'll be of any use to anyone.

30:09.470 --> 30:11.340
What's wrong, Riko?

30:12.260 --> 30:14.190
It must have been Three.

30:25.020 --> 30:30.580
Satoshi, doesn't Spikes over there remind you of the guy who was sobbing at our feet?

30:30.580 --> 30:33.230
Yeah, I recognize his face from somewhere.

30:33.230 --> 30:36.560
He was the one who begged us for forgiveness on his hands and knees.

30:37.930 --> 30:39.520
Oh, I remember now!

30:39.980 --> 30:42.560
His name was Itou... Itou...

30:44.090 --> 30:45.480
Shinnosuke, wasn't it?

30:45.480 --> 30:46.810
Itou Shinji!

30:46.810 --> 30:48.940
This prick's sure got a bad memory.

30:49.540 --> 30:54.440
Itou, didn't you promise you wouldn't raise your hands against us anymore?

30:55.070 --> 30:59.170
Or were you lying to us back then, Itou?

31:02.120 --> 31:04.720
Don't sweat it. Go on and say it.

31:06.170 --> 31:09.260
You know, your favorite saying.

31:09.260 --> 31:11.840
You're an honest guy, Itou Shinji.

31:16.540 --> 31:17.550
I take it back.

31:18.040 --> 31:18.760
What?

31:19.280 --> 31:23.060
I don't like getting punched, so I lied to you, shit-for-brains!

31:23.060 --> 31:25.540
Wow, you <i>actually said it!</i>

31:25.540 --> 31:26.820
You're dead to me now.

31:28.740 --> 31:30.270
Damn you!

31:30.270 --> 31:32.410
I'm pulling your leg.

31:32.710 --> 31:37.740
It was your fault for believing it, dipshit.

31:38.640 --> 31:43.130
Are you guys too backward to realize who you're up against?

31:43.780 --> 31:46.560
Maybe? I dunno...

31:46.560 --> 31:47.240
Dude...

31:48.590 --> 31:52.040
I'm gonna pound you so hard, you won't be able to spout your shit anymore!

31:54.570 --> 31:56.990
You can't even fight one on one?!

31:56.990 --> 31:57.750
Mitsuhashi!

32:08.400 --> 32:10.400
Are you a cyborg?

32:10.400 --> 32:13.420
That coulda hurt, shithead!

32:16.140 --> 32:18.440
Bring it on, you pussies!

32:41.990 --> 32:43.180
They just keep on coming!

32:45.750 --> 32:47.450
Wow...

32:50.680 --> 32:53.440
Look at those two go...

32:53.440 --> 32:57.100
If they wanna take me on, they have to keep on winning.

33:00.160 --> 33:04.580
But I don't think even they can take out that many guys.

33:07.550 --> 33:10.330
This is bad. They're pinned down!

33:10.870 --> 33:12.040
Imai.

33:19.300 --> 33:20.460
Strange...

33:21.300 --> 33:23.840
I'm supposed to be enjoying this.

33:30.700 --> 33:33.340
God! I'm such a bleeding heart!

33:33.340 --> 33:36.320
Tanigawa! Stay here, you hear?!

33:36.710 --> 33:37.270
Gotcha!

33:49.860 --> 33:54.210
Aren't you guys fucking ashamed of sending out so many guys to finish off two runts?

33:54.210 --> 33:55.880
You're dragging Akehisa's name through the dirt.

33:56.490 --> 33:57.520
Who're you?

33:57.520 --> 33:59.170
It's Imai!

33:59.170 --> 33:59.640
Huh?

33:59.940 --> 34:01.700
You got here just in time, Pigsy!

34:01.700 --> 34:03.420
Friar Sand Itou was lonely without you!

34:06.590 --> 34:08.120
Who're you calling Pigsy?!

34:08.120 --> 34:10.400
Just so you know, I didn't come to save you guys!

34:10.400 --> 34:13.050
Listen up, Akehisa scumbags!

34:13.410 --> 34:18.900
This guy here is a real don and my best friend, Imai Katsutoshi!

34:20.060 --> 34:20.780
Imai?

34:21.220 --> 34:25.720
That's right! You guys are ants compared to him!

34:25.720 --> 34:27.100
Ain't that right, Imai?

34:34.590 --> 34:37.770
I shouldn't have gotten involved, after all.

34:37.770 --> 34:39.900
Now, go for it, Imai!

35:03.950 --> 35:07.440
You guys put up a good fight, but it looks like this is the end for you.

35:07.750 --> 35:11.020
You sure talk big, considering you needed an army to do it!

35:12.120 --> 35:14.620
Winning's all that matters, Itou.

35:14.620 --> 35:16.240
He's right.

35:16.240 --> 35:18.840
That's how it should be.

35:18.840 --> 35:21.290
I was hoping I could use that as justification.

35:22.880 --> 35:23.920
What're you trying to say?

35:26.030 --> 35:28.140
This!

35:37.410 --> 35:39.600
Winning's all that matters, right?

35:39.600 --> 35:41.100
I completely agree.

35:42.220 --> 35:44.190
You're so predictable in these situations.

35:44.660 --> 35:46.680
Right, get them on my mark!

35:46.680 --> 35:47.400
Right!

35:47.690 --> 35:49.020
Hey, stop!

35:49.020 --> 35:50.360
That's dirty!

35:50.880 --> 35:53.550
Winning's all that matters, dribbler!

35:53.550 --> 35:54.820
Eat this!

35:57.780 --> 35:58.720
Huh?

35:58.720 --> 36:00.390
M-Mitsuhashi...

36:00.390 --> 36:02.000
Gimme a break...

36:02.390 --> 36:03.860
What a jackass.

36:03.860 --> 36:04.790
Kill them!

36:04.790 --> 36:05.700
Right!

36:12.760 --> 36:14.700
Three!

36:22.920 --> 36:25.160
Eat this!

36:30.670 --> 36:31.020
Imai!

36:31.570 --> 36:32.500
Gotcha!

36:48.580 --> 36:49.980
The big one...

36:49.980 --> 36:52.140
Go for the biggest one...

36:55.700 --> 36:57.460
There!

37:04.420 --> 37:10.570
Take that! And that! And that!

37:12.030 --> 37:13.900
Are you sure this isn't bad for our lungs?

37:15.580 --> 37:18.350
But look! I kicked the ass of Akehisa's big cheese.

37:18.350 --> 37:20.100
What are you talking about?

37:33.100 --> 37:38.900
You think you can beat Akehisa using playground tricks?

37:39.410 --> 37:42.420
Then, who's this guy?

37:44.820 --> 37:53.610
There's always one unlucky guy in every group... Always one...

37:53.610 --> 37:55.410
I-Imai...

37:57.580 --> 37:59.330
Y-You bastard!

37:59.330 --> 38:02.710
How dare you do that to my best friend, Imai!

38:02.710 --> 38:06.600
That's physically impossible, Mitsuhashi. You're not convincing anyone.

38:06.600 --> 38:07.540
I'm not?

38:08.160 --> 38:10.620
Quit flapping your gums and bring it!

38:11.130 --> 38:13.180
Ooh, tough guy!

38:13.180 --> 38:15.310
It's two versus one!

38:15.310 --> 38:16.620
You got that?!

38:17.900 --> 38:21.220
I'll take on both of you at once. Come at me.

38:22.310 --> 38:25.540
I'll take care of him. I owe him for last time.

38:25.540 --> 38:26.690
Wait, Itou.

38:26.690 --> 38:27.740
I'll take him.

38:27.740 --> 38:29.570
I let you have Sagara, didn't I?

38:29.570 --> 38:30.620
It's my turn this time.

38:30.620 --> 38:33.200
Okay, fine.

38:33.200 --> 38:34.780
Ah! Itou!

38:40.140 --> 38:42.410
Looks like I'm your opponent.

38:43.890 --> 38:46.120
You think you can take me one on one?

38:46.800 --> 38:49.080
I'm the strongest bad boy in Japan.

38:50.090 --> 38:52.020
Quit spouting horseshit!

38:52.450 --> 38:54.180
Bring it!

39:05.680 --> 39:06.630
This punk...

39:08.450 --> 39:12.690
I can see why he's Akehisa's boss... He's pretty damn strong...

39:21.780 --> 39:23.100
Three...

39:28.200 --> 39:30.040
Well, ain't this convenient?

39:38.870 --> 39:41.110
Hold it right there, Mitsuhashi.

39:42.860 --> 39:45.830
Don't you care if her fragile, little arm breaks?

39:46.280 --> 39:47.140
Well?!

39:48.250 --> 39:49.230
Riko!

39:49.650 --> 39:51.250
You rat bastard...

39:51.250 --> 39:53.560
Always pulling dick moves!

39:53.900 --> 39:55.430
Whaddaya think, Satoshi?

39:55.430 --> 39:59.040
As long as we've got his woman, Blondie over there won't do a damn thing.

39:59.040 --> 40:01.740
Sagara, don't get in my way!

40:02.070 --> 40:03.660
Hey now, cut me some slack.

40:03.660 --> 40:06.450
After I came all the way out here to back you up.

40:07.920 --> 40:08.340
What the...

40:13.870 --> 40:16.090
No way...

40:16.920 --> 40:20.960
Twisting a lady's arm like that... What a jerk.

40:21.410 --> 40:22.970
Oh wow...

40:27.040 --> 40:28.520
Over there, Officer!

40:28.520 --> 40:30.060
Fuck!

40:30.640 --> 40:31.540
Shit!

40:30.960 --> 40:32.740
Hey, hold it right there!

40:34.620 --> 40:36.020
They got away...

40:38.040 --> 40:41.230
This guy's out cold...

40:53.690 --> 40:55.680
They're a real thorn in my side.

41:06.540 --> 41:08.360
Yo. I've been waiting for you.

41:11.300 --> 41:12.410
Perfect.

41:12.410 --> 41:14.240
Now I don't have to look for you.

41:49.390 --> 41:52.220
What's wrong? You down and out already?

41:52.220 --> 41:53.430
What's that?

41:53.430 --> 41:55.340
Try looking at yourself...

41:58.830 --> 42:01.780
For fuck's sake, just stay down already.

42:01.780 --> 42:03.990
Your legs must hurt like hell!

42:04.380 --> 42:05.900
Shut the hell up!

42:05.900 --> 42:08.000
Nobody fucks with Akehisa!

42:08.600 --> 42:14.120
I'm Akehisa's boss, Katagiri Satoshi! You got that?!

42:14.880 --> 42:18.830
If we're doing roll call, I'm the lone blond wolf, Mitsuhashi Takashi.

42:19.220 --> 42:21.930
I'll crush all who take me on.

42:21.930 --> 42:23.580
That's all there is to it!

42:37.340 --> 42:38.690
Goddamn!

42:38.690 --> 42:42.510
I'm Akehisa's boss! Do you understand that, you little shit?!

42:58.790 --> 43:02.260
This is bullshit... Someone from Nanyou actually...

43:02.260 --> 43:03.770
Just so you know...

43:04.120 --> 43:06.890
Itou's way stronger than I am.

43:09.460 --> 43:10.380
Hey!

43:10.380 --> 43:11.630
Wait a sec!

43:22.420 --> 43:23.320
Yo.

43:28.570 --> 43:29.750
You?

43:30.700 --> 43:34.620
Yo. You're looking good, Katagiri Satoshi.

43:34.620 --> 43:37.580
What? You're gonna take me on now?!

43:38.920 --> 43:39.790
Give it up.

43:39.790 --> 43:41.700
Your tough-guy act is getting embarrassing.

43:41.680 --> 43:45.370
Don't fuck with me! I'm more than tough enough to take you on!

43:45.370 --> 43:46.220
Bring it!

43:54.550 --> 43:55.860
Come on!

43:56.310 --> 43:57.770
Or have you lost your nerve?

43:59.020 --> 44:00.400
Running away?!

44:01.700 --> 44:03.590
Don't bring me down to your level.

44:04.090 --> 44:09.060
Itou Shinji doesn't go around picking on weaklings.

44:09.060 --> 44:10.110
Later.

44:10.450 --> 44:11.820
Stop right there, dammit!

44:11.820 --> 44:14.080
Who do you think I...

44:19.130 --> 44:22.530
Him and his cheesy lines...

44:27.450 --> 44:29.760
What am I getting all worked up about?

44:31.860 --> 44:33.030
He's strong...

44:33.370 --> 44:35.620
The guy who sang your praises.

44:52.980 --> 44:55.600
Hey, it's Satoshi!

44:57.450 --> 44:59.130
What's up with your face?

44:59.130 --> 45:02.990
Don't tell me you got beat up again.

45:05.880 --> 45:08.180
C'mon! Say something!

45:10.380 --> 45:12.890
Hey, runt, the old crew is talking to you here—

45:20.780 --> 45:23.560
Knock it off! What're you getting all serious for?

45:23.560 --> 45:25.400
I-It was just a joke.

45:27.110 --> 45:29.980
You guys piss me off!

45:44.890 --> 45:48.840
This is what a thug should be like.

45:51.790 --> 45:54.460
You idiot. What are you on about?

45:54.460 --> 45:55.950
Shut up.

45:55.950 --> 45:58.120
I'm never teaming up with you again.

45:58.120 --> 46:00.170
Sounds great to me.

46:00.170 --> 46:01.530
You wanna start something?

46:01.530 --> 46:04.050
You can bring it anytime!

46:19.080 --> 46:21.190
Let's worry about the future tomorrow.

46:21.190 --> 46:23.630
When tomorrow comes, it'll all work out.

46:27.190 --> 46:29.230
If it doesn't work out, I'll just run away.

46:29.230 --> 46:31.470
If I'm found, I'll make up an excuse.

46:35.170 --> 46:37.210
You and me are friends, partner.

46:37.210 --> 46:38.950
If the going gets tough, the tough say goodbye.

46:43.150 --> 46:45.230
I help you.

46:44.070 --> 46:45.230
We're family.

46:45.230 --> 46:47.190
I like you.

46:59.180 --> 47:01.150
On stressful days, I'll hit you.

47:01.150 --> 47:03.670
Then, I'll say, "I'm sorry," and you'll forgive me.

47:07.060 --> 47:08.600
That cute girl is mine,

47:08.600 --> 47:11.690
but I belong to no one.

47:15.130 --> 47:17.150
We're all brothers and sisters in this world.

47:17.150 --> 47:19.150
When the going gets tough, the tough kick and scream.

47:19.150 --> 47:21.190
We are all brothers and sisters in this world.

47:47.170 --> 47:49.170
You and me are friends, partner.

47:49.170 --> 47:51.010
If the going gets tough, the tough say goodbye.

48:18.880 --> 48:18.920
See Ya!

48:21.620 --> 48:22.960
See you next time!
